ef-2\" data-note=\"d59b0b327715a4b0\" href=\"?note=d59b0b327715a4b0\" title=\"67-df-complete\">67-df-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7fdea8f95f2861a9\" href=\"?note=7fdea8f95f2861a9\" title=\"67-thm-generalized-quantifier-incompleteness\">67-thm-generalized-quantifier-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3b04e0df1122f31\" href=\"?note=d3b04e0df1122f31\" title=\"67-df-effective-calculus\">67-df-effective-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a548cb5c1ed94888\" href=\"?note=a548cb5c1ed94888\" title=\"67-df-quantifier-language\">67-df-quantifier-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e972b0d757b4f3a3\" href=\"?note=e972b0d757b4f3a3\" title=\"67-thm-rosser-incompleteness\">67-thm-rosser-incompleteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"historical-abstract-logic-material-not-located-in-this-book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_search_scope","html":"provided PDF full text, contents and index; book 57 not re-audited"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"pending-source-outside-book"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=1\">\\(q=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_0=Q_{\\mathcal K}\">\\(Q_0=Q_{\\mathcal K}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"336238f06be8e591\" href=\"?note=336238f06be8e591\" title=\"67-df-lindstrom-quantifier\">67-df-lindstrom-quantifier</a> 的类型及同构封闭条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)\">\\(\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d3b04e0df1122f31\" href=\"?note=d3b04e0df1122f31\" title=\"67-df-effective-calculus\">67-df-effective-calculus</a> 的候选演算。所有可证性、REAx、一致性及完全性均使用该文件的带语言、演算下标接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)\\)</span> 是下式显式前提；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> 的 Robinson 算术，不是广义量词符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_\\Lambda(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\land T\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\neg\\varphi)\\right]\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal C,\\Lambda}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_\\Lambda(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\land T\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\neg\\varphi)\\right]\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal C,\\Lambda}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由有效性与递归可枚举公理集，算术可证句集可枚举；ArithExt 使其成为含 Q 的经典演绎闭包，演算一致性使该闭包一致。对该算术理论应用 Rosser 不完备性即可。结论并未断言任意广义量词的全部语义后承都有这种有效演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-lindstrom-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"336238f06be8e591","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-lindstrom-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-complete","status":"resolved","id":"d59b0b327715a4b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-generalized-quantifier-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-generalized-quantifier-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-effective-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-effective-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-quantifier-language","status":"resolved","id":"a548cb5c1ed94888","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-quantifier-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-rosser-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"e972b0d757b4f3a3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-lindstrom-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"336238f06be8e591","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q=1$，$Q_0=Q_{\\mathcal K}$，$\\mathcal K$ 满足 [[67-df-lindstrom-quantifier]] 的类型及同构封闭条件。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-effective-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda$；$\\mathcal C$ 为 [[67-df-effective-calculus]] 的候选演算。所有可证性、REAx、一致性及完全性均使用该文件的带语言、演算下标接口。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)$ 与 $\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)$ 是下式显式前提；$Q$ 是 [[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]] 的 Robinson 算术，不是广义量词符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"q=1","display":false},{"tex":"Q_0=Q_{\\mathcal K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Eff}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{ArithExt}(\\mathcal C,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_\\Lambda(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal C}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\land T\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\neg\\varphi)\\right]\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal C,\\Lambda}(T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2401,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-lindstrom-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-lindstrom-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["336238f06be8e591","d59b0b327715a4b0","9f0e08fd1022847c","ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","7fdea8f95f2861a9","824fdc45d800b7dd","d3b04e0df1122f31","a548cb5c1ed94888","e972b0d757b4f3a3"]}